WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:08.180
Follow every WhatsApp chat and email thread with brands, assign them and reply from the office.

2
00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:13.410
Conversations brings every WhatsApp chat and email with brands into one list.

3
00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:17.380
Filter by unread, yours, WhatsApp, email or closed.

4
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:23.400
Open a conversation. Reem would like to visit the site on Sunday.

5
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:30.470
The header shows the channel, the number and the lead it belongs to, one click away.

6
00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:36.240
Assign it to the colleague who should answer. They are notified at once.

7
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:42.640
Email threads work the same way. Khaled asks for the signage guidelines.

8
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.130
Write your reply here.

9
00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.890
Quick replies paste a ready answer you use often, like a viewing confirmation.

10
00:00:53.890 --> 00:01:03.910
Send email delivers it from the leasing address. Your reply joins the thread, and the lead's timeline keeps a copy for the whole team.

11
00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:11.450
When the matter is settled, close the conversation. It opens again by itself if they write back.
